## Method

Per instruction I preferred mutation over reading. I copied the repo to a
scratch tree OUTSIDE the repository
(`$SCRATCH/mut`, 249M) and, for each guard I care about, broke it there and
recorded which NAMED test died. The repository itself was never modified;
`git status` is confirmed unchanged at the end of this file.

20 mutations (M1-M20) plus one FIX-CHECK. Results inline below.

